{"product_id":"unseen-vogue-the-secret-history-of-fashion-photography","title":"Unseen Vogue: The Secret History of Fashion Photography","description":"\u003cp\u003eUnseen Vogue goes beyond the cliches and often repeated \"greatest hits\" of fashion photography and tells a completely new story. Drawn from the archives of British Vogue, the book presents hundreds of images never seen beforethe killed pictures, rejects, and outtakesto form a fresh, new history of fashion photography. Features the first attempts of many now internationally famous photographers, great pictures by forgotten masters, outtakes from famous shoots, and many other extraordinary and sometimes controversial pictures. By showing contact sheets and unedited film Unseen Vogue opens up the process of making fashion images, previously the reserve of fashion's inner circle.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 337 x 406\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Robin Derrick | Robin Muir\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780316860239\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 352\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45820864626841,"sku":"17RC-39780316860239","price":80.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68f9d5c822095_Unseen_Vogue-_The_Secret_History_of_Fashion_Photography_Robin_Derrick___Robin_Muir.jpg?v=1761233748","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/unseen-vogue-the-secret-history-of-fashion-photography","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}